  "details": "There is a bug where player profiles fail to load their correct Trust Ranks in-game. Instead of showing their actual rank, every single player's profile defaults to the green \"User\" rank when viewed.\n\nThis has been tested across multiple accounts, proving it is a system-wide backend issue rather than an isolated account problem.\n\nThe bug is completely independent of local hardware, network configurations, or location. It occurs on the PC client, and the Android mobile app (for what i've tested), even when using entirely separate internet connections and cellular data. Clearing the game cache or reinstalling does not fix the issue. Crucially, the official VRChat Home Website displays everyone's profile ranks perfectly. \n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\n1.Log into VRChat on any device (PC or Mobile) using any valid account.\n\n2.Open the profile of any other active player in-game.\n\n3.Observe that their profile displays the green \"User\" rank.\n\n4.Check the exact same player's profile on the VRChat website and observe that they display their correct, higher rank.",
